{
  "uid": "shopeasy-slo",
  "title": "ShopEasy SLOs",
  "tags": [
    "shopeasy"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "title": "ShopEasy dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "shopeasy"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "icon": "external link"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Where the budget stands",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Availability budget left",
      "description": "Of the share of gateway answers that may be a server error (5xx) - 0.5 %, for an objective of 99.5 % - how much is left over the span Prometheus holds (up to 30 days; less after a fresh start). 100 %: none spent. Below 0: the objective is missed. Health checks are not counted. Runbook: https://github.com/AmirGHTo/ShopEasy/blob/main/README.md#errorbudgetfastburn",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "1 - shopeasy:gateway_bad_ratio:rate30d{sli=\"availability\"} / on(sli) shopeasy:slo_budget:ratio",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.25
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latency budget left",
      "description": "Of the share of gateway answers that may take longer than 2 seconds (5 %, for an objective of 95 % under 2 s; counted at the 2.048 s edge of the histogram) - how much is left over the span Prometheus holds. Below 0: the objective is missed. Runbook: https://github.com/AmirGHTo/ShopEasy/blob/main/README.md#errorbudgetslowburn",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "1 - shopeasy:gateway_bad_ratio:rate30d{sli=\"latency\"} / on(sli) shopeasy:slo_budget:ratio",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.25
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Burn rate now (1 h)",
      "description": "How many times faster than the month allows the budget was spent over the last hour: 1 uses it exactly up in 30 days, 14.4 would use it up in 2 days (the line of ErrorBudgetFastBurn, together with the last 5 minutes), 6 in 5 days (ErrorBudgetSlowBurn, over 6 hours). No data: the gateway got no requests. Runbook: https://github.com/AmirGHTo/ShopEasy/blob/main/README.md#errorbudgetfastburn",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "shopeasy:gateway_bad_ratio:rate1h / on(sli) shopeasy:slo_budget:ratio",
          "legendFormat": "{{sli}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 6
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 14.4
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "How fast it is burning",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Burn rate - availability",
      "description": "How many times too fast the availability budget is spent, over 5 minutes, 1 hour and 6 hours. A graph that stays over the orange line (6) for hours is a leak (ErrorBudgetSlowBurn); the 1 hour and 5 minute lines both over the red one (14.4) is an outage (ErrorBudgetFastBurn). Runbook: https://github.com/AmirGHTo/ShopEasy/blob/main/README.md#errorbudgetfastburn",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "shopeasy:gateway_bad_ratio:rate5m{sli=\"availability\"} / on(sli) shopeasy:slo_budget:ratio",
          "legendFormat": "5 min"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "shopeasy:gateway_bad_ratio:rate1h{sli=\"availability\"} / on(sli) shopeasy:slo_budget:ratio",
          "legendFormat": "1 h"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "shopeasy:gateway_bad_ratio:rate6h{sli=\"availability\"} / on(sli) shopeasy:slo_budget:ratio",
          "legendFormat": "6 h"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 6
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 14.4
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Burn rate - latency",
      "description": "The same for answers slower than 2 seconds, whose budget is 5 %: the red line is 72 % of the answers being slow. Runbook: https://github.com/AmirGHTo/ShopEasy/blob/main/README.md#errorbudgetslowburn",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "shopeasy:gateway_bad_ratio:rate5m{sli=\"latency\"} / on(sli) shopeasy:slo_budget:ratio",
          "legendFormat": "5 min"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "shopeasy:gateway_bad_ratio:rate1h{sli=\"latency\"} / on(sli) shopeasy:slo_budget:ratio",
